                <pb facs="0408" n="280" xml:id="pg280"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 220.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Holguin and Mr. Becerra</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-07-31"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 31,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The speedy pacification of Colombia, which the recovery of Barranquilla presages,
                    is hailed with satisfaction.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <closer><signed>T. F. BAYARD.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
